    "body": "Yes; I want something that will return `300` [in this example](https://codepen.io/eeeps/pen/wvgMPdP?editors=1111), rather than `100`.\r\n\r\nThen, I can compare that something to `img.getBoundingClientRect().width` to see how wrong my `sizes` is (at this viewport size).",
