    "body": "This makes sense to me, and it seems easy for browsers to expose this information, and as demonstrated, relatively hard for web developers to get right. If you want to get it right including error handling or CSS syntax edge cases (e.g. `/* , */`), it's really hard to get right (or you'd need to pull in a CSS parsing library).",
